# SPEC GOLDEN — positioned boxes are laid out before paint, never rediscovered there.
#
# The UA body margin is 2 cells horizontally and 1 vertically. `#card` has
# 16px (= 2 cells) padding, so its content starts at (2, 1): its padding is
# represented in the card's outer rectangle and the inspector prints the
# content rectangle. `#close` is absolute: top/left 16px place it at (2, 1),
# against #card's padding box, and it consumes no row before #copy. `#badge`
# is first laid out in the inline row at (2, 2), then relative left/top 16px
# shift its final subtree to (4, 3) without changing that row's static place.
<html>  x=0 y=0 w=20 h=4
  <body>  x=0 y=0 w=20 h=4
    <div#card>  x=2 y=1 w=16 h=2
      <div#close>  x=2 y=1 w=2 h=1
        anonymous  x=2 y=1 w=2 h=1
          line  x=2 y=1 w=2 h=1
            #text "x"  x=2 y=1 w=1 h=1
      <p#copy>  x=2 y=1 w=16 h=1
        anonymous  x=2 y=1 w=16 h=1
          line  x=2 y=1 w=16 h=1
            #text "copy"  x=2 y=1 w=4 h=1
      anonymous  x=2 y=2 w=16 h=1
        line  x=2 y=2 w=16 h=1
          <span#badge>  x=4 y=3 w=5 h=1
            anonymous  x=4 y=3 w=5 h=1
              line  x=4 y=3 w=5 h=1
                #text "badge"  x=4 y=3 w=5 h=1
